        "description": "Typical proliferative phase followed by involution phase of hemangiomas",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "At least two major criteria including multiple cutaneous hemangiomas and confirmed extracutaneous involvement",
    "notes": "Imaging studies such as ultrasound or MRI are essential to confirm visceral involvement."
